# Models — never in-tree; see CLAUDE.md for the expected location
# F1/G8: anchored -- the bare pattern swallowed src/models/ for the repo's
# whole life, and the first fix put this comment ON the pattern line, where
# git reads it as part of the pattern (inert). Comment lines start at col 0.
/models/
*.gguf

